<title>UK: Commercial Union names head of UK division.</title>
<headline>Commercial Union names head of UK division.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>British insurer Commercial Union Plc said on Friday it named Cees Schrauwers to the newly-created post of managing director of its UK division, effective July 1.</p>
<p>Schrauwers, previously in charge of the company's UK non-life insurance businesses, will be responsible for all life and non-life trading and support activities in the UK, the firm said in a statement. --London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
